WEBVTT

00:24:29.913 --> 00:24:32.246
But, you know, it's a place to start.

00:24:32.246 --> 00:24:35.663
And there is very little data on it,
at least from a site perspective.

00:24:35.954 --> 00:24:39.871
She was familiar with a classic study
of Olympic athletes on the podium.

00:24:39.871 --> 00:24:42.829
Bronze medalists looked happier
than silver medalists.

00:24:43.413 --> 00:24:47.996
The poor silver medalist were disappointed
. I almost won a gold.

00:24:48.954 --> 00:24:52.454
The bronze medalist felt lucky.
At least I got a medal.

00:24:53.163 --> 00:24:56.663
Emily wondered if something similar would
hold for recession graduates.

00:24:56.996 --> 00:24:59.996
I found that people who graduated when
the economy was doing worse,